{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Only / Solo Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No internet connection required\u2014enjoy the full experience on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-on-4 Team Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All teammates and enemies are AI-controlled. Teamwork and situational awareness are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Controls \u00d7 Fast-Paced Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated inputs required. Enjoy speedy robot battles with intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage-Clear Progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces powerful bosses. Clear a stage to earn points, then use those points to unlock new weapons. Gaining stronger equipment expands your tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite simple rules, battles are intense and difficult. Repeated attempts are often required, but the sense of achievement when you finally succeed is immense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to pilot your robot and defeat the enemy team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced combat action and simple yet powerful battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHumanity was defeated by AI technology. Yet, it did not perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bipedal weapons created by AI were captured and modified for human use. Reprogrammed AI units were added as allies, and the fight began anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are humanity\u2019s last pilot. With three AI partners at your side, launch into battle.\u201d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018640?t=1760233725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018640?t=1760233725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_